01:00:18.680 --> 01:00:39.320
<v Kizzmekia  Corbett>OK, so if my family or if my siblings or my friends are listening to this, first of all, they're like, OK, yeah, right, you haven't cried this entire year. You cry all the time. So I'm a huge cry baby, and my cries are ugly. It was the cry you might expect to have if you won the lottery.
<v Kizzmekia  Corbett>好的，所以如果我的家人或者我的兄弟姐妹或者我的朋友在听这个，首先，他们会想，好的，是的，没错，你今年从来没哭过。你一直在哭。所以我是一个巨大的爱哭鬼，而我的哭很丑。它是那种如果你赢了彩票可能会有的哭泣。

01:00:39.320 --> 01:01:17.800
<v Kizzmekia  Corbett>I don't even know if my family even today understands what just happened with me over the last year. If I were to call them about 90% efficacy results, they'd be like, OK, what is that? I actually still haven't communicated with my family about the efficacy results at all. I talk to them all the time. I just talked to my dad this morning about fixing a dishwasher in my rental property, so I talk to them all the time. But I don't know.
<v Kizzmekia  Corbett>我甚至不知道我的家人今天是否理解过去一年我身上发生了什么。如果我要打电话给他们关于90%功效的结果，他们会说，好的，那是什么？我实际上仍然根本没有与我的家人交流关于功效结果的事。我一直在与他们谈话。我今天早上才刚刚和爸爸谈过修复我出租房里的洗碗机，所以我一直在与他们谈话。但我不知道。

01:01:17.800 --> 01:01:32.290
<v Nianshuang Wang>Yeah, it feels, oh, God, it's actually working now. So it's really going to save a lot of people. So I think I'm proud of it. And it's great.
